        "en-US": "\"Frameworks\" may be interpreted broadly to include any scheme or schema for organizing and referencing resources."
    },
    "vann:usageNote": {
        "en-US": "Used to compare concepts in concept schemes, levels in progression models, types of resource in an ontology etc."
    },
